{"id":"t6-arab-kafa","tahap":"T6","nama":"Bahasa Arab (KAFA)","sk":"Bahasa Arab","ikon":"🕌","warna":"#C0703A","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 6 (ikut e-buku Bahasa Arab Tahun 6)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"Original notes and questions following the 10 lessons of the owner's e-BOOK BAHASA ARAB Tahun 6 (JAIS); shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-1","nama":"Nombor 600 hingga 2000","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Nombor"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">سِتُّمِائَةٍ</span> : 600","<span class=\"arab\">سَبْعُمِائَةٍ</span> : 700","<span class=\"arab\">ثَمَانِمِائَةٍ</span> : 800","<span class=\"arab\">تِسْعُمِائَةٍ</span> : 900","<span class=\"arab\">أَلْفٌ</span> : 1000","<span class=\"arab\">أَلْفٌ وَخَمْسُمِائَةٍ</span> : 1500","<span class=\"arab\">أَلْفَانِ</span> : 2000"]},{"j":"h","t":"Perbualan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">أُرِيدُ أَنْ أَشْتَرِيَ هٰذِهِ الثَّلَّاجَةَ، كَمْ سِعْرُهَا؟</span> : Saya mahu membeli peti sejuk ini, berapa harganya?","<span class=\"arab\">سِعْرُهَا مُعْتَدِلٌ</span> : Harganya sederhana."]}],"glosari":[["Seribu","<span class=\"arab\">أَلْفٌ</span>"],["Dua ribu","<span class=\"arab\">أَلْفَانِ</span>"]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-2","nama":"Wazan fi'il","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Wazan"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Wazan}} ialah timbangan perkataan menggunakan huruf <span class=\"arab\">ف ع ل</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">فَعَلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">كَتَبَ ، ذَهَبَ ، فَتَحَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَعِلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">شَرِبَ ، فَرِحَ ، عَلِمَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَعُلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">كَرُمَ ، حَسُنَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">أَفْعَلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">أَكْرَمَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَعَّلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">عَلَّمَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَاعَلَ</span> : <span class=\"arab\">سَاعَدَ</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Wazan","Timbangan atau pola perkataan."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-3","nama":"Cerita: berbuat baik kepada ibu bapa","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Birrul walidain"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بِرُّ الْوَالِدَيْنِ</span> bermaksud berbuat baik kepada ibu bapa. Seorang anak membantu ibunya di rumah, mendengar nasihat ayahnya, dan mendoakan mereka setiap hari. Keredaan Allah bergantung kepada keredaan ibu bapa."},{"j":"h","t":"Perkataan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">وَالِدَانِ</span> : ibu bapa","<span class=\"arab\">طَاعَةٌ</span> : taat","<span class=\"arab\">نَصِيحَةٌ</span> : nasihat","<span class=\"arab\">دُعَاءٌ</span> : doa","<span class=\"arab\">سَاعَدَ</span> : membantu"]},{"j":"h","t":"Dalil"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَبِالْوَالِدَيْنِ إِحْسَانًا</span> (Surah al-Isra': 23) — dan berbuat baiklah kepada kedua ibu bapa."}],"glosari":[["Birrul walidain","Berbuat baik kepada ibu bapa."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-4","nama":"Tasrif fi'il","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tasrif"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Tasrif}} ialah perubahan bentuk fi'il mengikut pelaku."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">كَتَبَ</span> : dia (lelaki) telah menulis","<span class=\"arab\">كَتَبَتْ</span> : dia (perempuan) telah menulis","<span class=\"arab\">كَتَبْتُ</span> : saya telah menulis","<span class=\"arab\">كَتَبْنَا</span> : kami telah menulis","<span class=\"arab\">كَتَبُوا</span> : mereka telah menulis","<span class=\"arab\">يَكْتُبُ</span> : dia (lelaki) sedang menulis","<span class=\"arab\">أَكْتُبُ</span> : saya sedang menulis","<span class=\"arab\">نَكْتُبُ</span> : kami sedang menulis"]}],"glosari":[["Tasrif","Perubahan bentuk kata kerja."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-5","nama":"Mubtada' dan khabar","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"l","t":["{{Mubtada'}}: kata nama di awal ayat namaan, berbaris di hadapan","{{Khabar}}: kata yang menerangkan mubtada', juga berbaris di hadapan"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh: keluarga bahagia"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">الْأُسْرَةُ سَعِيدَةٌ</span> : Keluarga itu bahagia.","<span class=\"arab\">الْأَبُ كَرِيمٌ</span> : Ayah itu pemurah.","<span class=\"arab\">الْأُمُّ رَحِيمَةٌ</span> : Ibu itu penyayang.","<span class=\"arab\">الْبَيْتُ نَظِيفٌ</span> : Rumah itu bersih."]}],"glosari":[["Mubtada'","Subjek ayat namaan."],["Khabar","Predikat yang menerangkan subjek."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-6","nama":"Huruf 'ataf","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Huruf 'ataf (penghubung)"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">وَ</span> : dan","<span class=\"arab\">فَـ</span> : lalu (segera)","<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ</span> : kemudian (selepas beberapa ketika)","<span class=\"arab\">أَوْ</span> : atau"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">جَاءَ أَحْمَدُ وَعَلِيٌّ</span> : Ahmad dan Ali datang.","<span class=\"arab\">دَخَلَ الْمُعَلِّمُ فَسَلَّمَ</span> : Guru masuk lalu memberi salam.","<span class=\"arab\">أَكَلْتُ ثُمَّ نِمْتُ</span> : Saya makan kemudian tidur."]}],"glosari":[["'Ataf","Penghubung."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-7","nama":"Kata berlawanan","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Al-kalimat al-mutadaddah"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">كَبِيرٌ</span> (besar) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">صَغِيرٌ</span> (kecil)","<span class=\"arab\">طَوِيلٌ</span> (panjang) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">قَصِيرٌ</span> (pendek)","<span class=\"arab\">جَدِيدٌ</span> (baharu) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">قَدِيمٌ</span> (lama)","<span class=\"arab\">حَارٌّ</span> (panas) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">بَارِدٌ</span> (sejuk)","<span class=\"arab\">سَهْلٌ</span> (mudah) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">صَعْبٌ</span> (susah)","<span class=\"arab\">نَظِيفٌ</span> (bersih) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">وَسِخٌ</span> (kotor)","<span class=\"arab\">قَرِيبٌ</span> (dekat) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">بَعِيدٌ</span> (jauh)","<span class=\"arab\">فَرِحَ</span> (gembira) ↔ <span class=\"arab\">حَزِنَ</span> (sedih)"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cerita: bermain api"},{"j":"p","t":"Dua orang budak bermain dengan mancis di dapur. Api membakar langsir dan rumah hampir terbakar. Ayah mereka segera memadamkan api. Mereka menyesal dan berjanji tidak akan bermain api lagi."}],"glosari":[["Berlawanan","Bermaksud bertentangan."],["Mancis","Alat untuk menyalakan api."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-8","nama":"Dialog","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ungkapan harian"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">أَهْلًا وَسَهْلًا</span> : selamat datang","<span class=\"arab\">لَوْ سَمَحْتَ</span> : jika kamu izinkan / tolong","<span class=\"arab\">أَيُّ خِدْمَةٍ؟</span> : boleh saya bantu?","<span class=\"arab\">عَفْوًا</span> : sama-sama / maaf","<span class=\"arab\">مَعَ السَّلَامَةِ</span> : selamat tinggal","<span class=\"arab\">إِنْ شَاءَ اللّٰهُ</span> : jika dikehendaki Allah","<span class=\"arab\">مَا شَاءَ اللّٰهُ</span> : dengan kehendak Allah (tanda kagum)"]}],"glosari":[["Dialog","Perbualan antara dua orang atau lebih."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-9","nama":"Hikmah dan peribahasa","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Al-hikam wal-amthal"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">الْعِلْمُ نُورٌ</span> : Ilmu itu cahaya.","<span class=\"arab\">النَّظَافَةُ مِنَ الْإِيمَانِ</span> : Kebersihan sebahagian daripada iman.","<span class=\"arab\">مَنْ جَدَّ وَجَدَ</span> : Sesiapa yang berusaha akan berjaya.","<span class=\"arab\">الْوَقْتُ مِنْ ذَهَبٍ</span> : Masa itu emas.","<span class=\"arab\">الصَّبْرُ مِفْتَاحُ الْفَرَجِ</span> : Sabar ialah kunci kejayaan.","<span class=\"arab\">خَيْرُ الْأُمُورِ أَوْسَطُهَا</span> : Sebaik-baik perkara ialah yang sederhana."]}],"glosari":[["Hikmah","Kata-kata yang bijak."],["Peribahasa","Ungkapan yang mengandungi nasihat."]]},{"id":"t6-arab-kafa-10","nama":"Ulang kaji bahasa Arab Tahun 6","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ringkasan"},{"j":"l","t":["Nombor hingga <span class=\"arab\">أَلْفَانِ</span>","Wazan <span class=\"arab\">فَعَلَ، فَعِلَ، فَعُلَ</span>","Mubtada' dan khabar","Huruf 'ataf <span class=\"arab\">وَ، فَـ، ثُمَّ، أَوْ</span>","Kata berlawanan dan hikmah"]}],"glosari":[["Bahasa Arab","Bahasa al-Quran."]]}]}